WEBVTT

00:01:58.036 --> 00:02:00.476
in a village in Denmark.

00:02:01.076 --> 00:02:02.956
Meets Henrik Stiesdal.

00:02:02.996 --> 00:02:06.116
He’s not an accomplished,
experienced engineer.

00:02:06.156 --> 00:02:08.796
He's 19 years old, a young man.

00:02:09.396 --> 00:02:11.876
He set himself a challenge.

00:02:12.276 --> 00:02:14.076
He thought,

00:02:14.076 --> 00:02:18.716
"What if I could make a wind turbine
that could produce electricity?"

00:02:19.316 --> 00:02:20.676
And you know what?

00:02:20.716 --> 00:02:21.876
He did.

00:02:22.236 --> 00:02:23.396
How do I know?

00:02:24.796 --> 00:02:25.996
Because that's it.

00:02:27.116 --> 00:02:28.796
Not a model, not a replica.

00:02:28.836 --> 00:02:31.556
This is the actual one that Henrik made.